From {{etyl|sla-pro|sh}} {{term/t|sla-pro|*čьto||what}}, from {{etyl|ine-pro|sh}} {{term/t|ine-pro|*kʷid}}, cf. {{term/t|ine-pro|*kʷis}}; compare Čakavian {{term|sc=Cyrl|ча|ча̏|what|lang=sh}} (from {{etyl|sla-pro|sh}} {{term/t|sla-pro|*čь}}).

===Alternative forms===
* {{l|sh|sc=Cyrl|шта̏}} (pronoun only)

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ʃtô/|lang=sh}}

===Adverb===
{{sh-adverb|head=што̏|c|što|štȍ}}

